; Nobody notifies the authority, and the number of records affected is never
; given. The entry of 5 June is strictly after the deadline, 28 May 10:00, so
; the obligation is breached at the deadline (deadline_missed_breach). The
; cure window, 7 days from the moment of breach, ends on 4 June 10:00; the
; same entry is strictly after it with no notification, so the cure is
; breached at its deadline too, and that second breach is final (cure_failed).
(scenario gdpr_no_notification
  (spec "examples/core/gdpr_art33_notification.triel")
  (entry "2026-05-25T10:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-05T10:00:00Z" (tick)
    (data)))
